{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mask Awakening: A 3D Fighting Journey to Reclaim Courage\u200c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timid youth Jack plunges into a mysterious realm where masks grant supernatural power, and combat is the only law. Forced into brutal battles, he must evolve from mask-dependent warrior to awakened hero with mentor guidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 \u200cDeep 3D Combat System\u200c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid combos blending strikes, grapples &amp; + mask skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hero roles: Boxers, Kick Specialists, Grapplers, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock-Paper-Scissors mechanics: Mask attributes counter specific enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect defeated foes' masks to unlock new abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental interactions (e.g. electric fields boost lightning masks)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 \u200cMask Shattering Mechanic\u200c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive &quot;Total Mask Break&quot; during boss defeats: Fight barehanded to trigger \u200cInner Awakening\u200c - a critical-damage state revealing true potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The strongest mask is your face when confronting fear.&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875020?t=1754642190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3875020?t=1754642190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875020/e1ca3418936d4e1f23b5dd8b2054f05c53c358c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754642190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875020/e1ca3418936d4e1f23b5dd8b2054f05c53c358c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754642190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_